@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
left to right direction
rectangle "Physical root\n(sourceTag, sourceEpoch, sampleId)\n+ original timestamp" as P
rectangle "Inner window U\nover 2 ms" as U
rectangle "Outer window W\nover 10 ms" as W
P --> U : samples (0,0) (1,10) (2,20)
U --> W : derived events (site, revision)\nvalues 0, 5, 15\nquality 3 + U's site
note bottom of W
  Average of 3 derived events = 20/3
  (NOT 10 from flattened physical leaves)
  Result quality: Derived (3)
end note
@enduml
